<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85100" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύ-μῡθος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		poet. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πουλύ-</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Call.
			<u>Iamb.</u>
			1.170
		</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυ-</span> Pap.):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wordy,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				3.214
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				2.200
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>much talked of, famous in story,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρεταί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					9.76
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>full of story,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Καλλιόπη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.523
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Epigr.</u>
				18
			</span></i>; <i>with a number of legends,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[σύστημα]</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Po.</u>
					1456a12
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				14.2.7
			</span></i>.</div>
